{"page":20252,"part":1,"text":"○掠势第六\n\n掠者拂掠，须迅其锋左出而欲利。又云：微曲而下笔心至卷处。口诀云：撇过谓之掠，借于策势以轻驻锋。右揭其腕，加以迅出势，旋于左法。在涩而劲，意欲畅而婉迟，留则伤于缓滞，夫侧锋右出谓之掠。\n\n问曰：掠一名分发，今称为掠，何也？\n\n论曰：掠乃徐疾有准，手随笔遣，锋自左出，取劲险画而为，即发则一出运用无的，故掠之。精旨可守矣！夫掠之笔趋，意欲留而必劲。又孙过庭《书谱》云：“遣不常远”，明矣。《笔诀》云：从策笔下左出而锋利，不坠则自然佳。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20252,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"de34f443be21e5a64aa34b18e1259ac7749324247728825bc407f6af0dbd3179","textSha256":"de34f443be21e5a64aa34b18e1259ac7749324247728825bc407f6af0dbd3179","fileSha256":"de34f443be21e5a64aa34b18e1259ac7749324247728825bc407f6af0dbd3179","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20252-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○掠势第六","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"15ccf89ad455c1e17eb9aadb3b68b4275c0a9d167881dc149d69db43854ab9d8","id":"kKF7jDoLPHYQAH6YkRZMxJ","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":98,"sourceTextSha256":"45367dbffe0f7cc87819cdd0f232f914d8dc1f7f8a21ccd79a8dbd7fa60c23f4","id":"nPtChcWKLz8waQWxKuMbqY","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":91},{"start":100,"end":117,"sourceTextSha256":"c1f936da76bd0784b5d463312b1f371139b9c80a6393f26bfabc40920e43b24d","id":"8JRKY8Vh8BhEeFsfLd8X3i","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":17},{"start":119,"end":222,"sourceTextSha256":"2a96803a07f94e902ba66cd30bb62f37ae